# 仓库里统一用 LF 换行，Windows 脚本例外。这样在 Windows 和 Linux 上提交的文件不会因为换行符不同而出现整文件的差异。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
